{
"k": "16037",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "No, miss."
},
{
"k": "16038",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't either."
},
{
"k": "16039",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}She looks like {ThinkingB}Holly."
},
{
"k": "16040",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[low] {FearA}Oh no."
},
{
"k": "16041",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedB}What is it?"
},
{
"k": "16042",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadB}I… {SadA}[cut]I think I know who it is."
},
{
"k": "16043",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}It's not Holly, it's {SadB}her sister Lily."
},
{
"k": "16044",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}She was reported missing, but I… {SadB}I guess it just slipped through the cracks."
},
{
"k": "16045",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}Maybe Holly knows."
},
{
"k": "16046",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}The owner of the Trip Trap? {ThinkingC}I don't think…"
},
{
"k": "16047",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}The owner of the Trip Trap? {ThinkingC}No she looks a little…"
},
{
"k": "16048",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{DoubtfulA}I'm not sure. {WorriedA}I guess I've never met her."
},
{
"k": "16049",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Hard to believe, {WorriedB}especially with so few of us here."
},
{
"k": "16050",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ConfusedB}The only other troll I've met {DoubtfulA}is Holly."
},
{
"k": "16051",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}The owner of the Trip Trap? {ThinkingC}Yeah, I…"
},
{
"k": "16052",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}Holly's sister… {SadB}Lily."
},
{
"k": "16053",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's gotta be Holly's sister, Lily."
},
{
"k": "16054",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Oh no."
},
{
"k": "16055",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "This is my fault."
},
{
"k": "16056",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[sadly] {SadA}You're right."
},
{
"k": "16057",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[softer] {SadB}I should have done something."
},
{
"k": "16058",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredA}She was killed, and…"
},
{
"k": "16059",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredB}And I did nothing."
},
{
"k": "16060",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadB}They asked for our help."
},
{
"k": "16061",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadB}I could have helped her."
},
{
"k": "16062",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}We're all responsible for this."
},
{
"k": "16063",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedB}It's not your fault."
},
{
"k": "16064",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}You're right. {ThinkingB}You should have."
},
{
"k": "16065",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}I know."
},
{
"k": "16066",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AngryA}You can't overlook people like this."
},
{
"k": "16067",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}Like you said, there's a whole community out there to serve."
},
{
"k": "16068",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AngryA}I have to make this right."
},
{
"k": "16069",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AngryA}We have to make this right."
},
{
"k": "16070",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}We can still help her. {AngryA}We can find who {AngryB}did this."
},
{
"k": "16071",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe she knows why Lily was glamoured as me."
},
{
"k": "16072",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[determined] First we have to tell Holly."
},
{
"k": "16073",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[blurts out] {ThinkingA}Certainly another troll."
},
{
"k": "16074",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FearA}Who knows, {ThinkingB}she might know something about this. {ThinkingC}Who Lily was seeing…"
},
{
"k": "16075",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "It's not going to be easy, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "16076",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I can't imagine…"
},
{
"k": "16077",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "In case Holly wants to see her."
},
{
"k": "16078",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "After everything that's happened… I must be made aware of your progress in order to decrease fallout from your rather unconventional methods."
},
{
"k": "16079",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need you to update me regularly, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "16080",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You must check in with me, let's say once every hour."
},
{
"k": "16081",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't want to hear about you cracking skulls out there or tossing people around. Do you understand?"
},
{
"k": "16082",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "You're on a short leash from now on."
},
{
"k": "16083",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}If the neck wound was the same, {FlusteredA}there might be a ribbon in her mouth too."
},
{
"k": "16084",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}So it's not {DoubtfulA}exactly the same."
},
{
"k": "16085",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[grimaces] That's somehow worse than the hand."
},
{
"k": "16086",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Exactly, so it depends on who had access to it… whatever did this."
},
{
"k": "16087",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FearA}But there's no ribbon in her mouth. {WorriedA}Do you think this was done by the same person?"
},
{
"k": "16088",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ConfusedB}Hard to tell."
},
{
"k": "16089",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Why bother with the right {ThinkingC}perfume if the appearance isn't completely accurate?"
},
{
"k": "16090",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingC}[cut]Though the track marks weren't accurate either."
},
{
"k": "16091",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's how TJ found her. She was already dead when they dropped her in the river."
},
{
"k": "16092",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SarcasticA}Maybe she was trying to compensate with that perfume."
},
{
"k": "16093",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}It's not a perfect match, {ThinkingA}with the brooch and these marks."
},
{
"k": "16094",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Just like that brooch."
},
{
"k": "16095",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Looks like she had the clothes and perfume prepared."
},
{
"k": "16096",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Maybe…"
},
{
"k": "16097",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I'd rather do it."
},
{
"k": "16098",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AnnoyedB}Well?"
},
{
"k": "16099",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredA}Why do you want to know?"
},
{
"k": "16100",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "If you're so worried, you should have done something about it."
},
{
"k": "16101",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Who knows what they did with the other half."
},
{
"k": "16102",
"who": "BUFKIN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ConfusedA}I imagine {SarcasticB}anyone with access to the {ThinkingA}proper books and training could {ConfusedA}theoretically produce a glamour."
},
{
"k": "16103",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Don't {SuspiciousA}you think?"
},
{
"k": "16104",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}Just to make sure it isn't {TenseA}dangerous."
},
{
"k": "16105",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[mumbling] {ThinkingA}Hmm."
},
{
"k": "16106",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[nervous] {WorriedA}What?"
},
{
"k": "16107",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "There's {ThinkingB}something in {DoubtfulA}here."
},
{
"k": "16108",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[low] {AnnoyedB}You've gotta be kidding me."
},
{
"k": "16109",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredB}You don't mean that, do you?"
},
{
"k": "16110",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AnnoyedB}Should've left them all back in the Homelands."
},
{
"k": "16111",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's disgusting."
},
{
"k": "16112",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadB}They came to me weeks ago."
},
{
"k": "16113",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "We didn't do anything to help her."
},
{
"k": "16114",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Holly must be so worried, and…"
},
{
"k": "16115",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[cold] {AnnoyedA}Then they probably assume she's dead already."
},
{
"k": "16116",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredA}How can you be so callous about this?"
},
{
"k": "16117",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AngryB}Why is this different, Crane?"
},
{
"k": "16118",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AngryA}Did you just {AngryB}let it go, because {AngryC}\"it happens all the time\"?"
},
{
"k": "16119",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[getting angry] {FlusteredB}Is that what you said when you thought it was me?"
},
{
"k": "16120",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{AnnoyedB}Because it's {AnnoyedA}not you."
},
{
"k": "16121",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[slightly wounded] {SadA}Of course not. {WorriedA}Snow…"
},
{
"k": "16122",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[dismissive] {AnnoyedB}This kind of thing {AnnoyedA}happens all the time."
},
{
"k": "16123",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[slight anger, sadness] {FlusteredA}She's still a part of this town. {AngryB}And now {AngryC}we have to tell Holly that her sister is dead. {WorriedA}All because {FearA}we didn't bother to look for her {SadA}when they asked us to."
},
{
"k": "16124",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "And now we have to tell her sister that this happened because we didn't bother to look for Lily when they asked us to."
},
{
"k": "16125",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't want you in danger, Snow."
},
{
"k": "16126",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I need to know what's going on out there."
},
{
"k": "16127",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingA}Looks like something from the Homelands."
},
{
"k": "16128",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Doesn't narrow it down much, does it?"
},
{
"k": "16129",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe a garden?"
},
{
"k": "16130",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Either she had lilacs nearby, or they have some significance."
},
{
"k": "16131",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I don't know…"
},
{
"k": "16132",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I keep those on my desk."
},
{
"k": "16133",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "That's strange…"
},
{
"k": "16134",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Why does she have them?"
},
{
"k": "16135",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Someone knows you like them."
},
{
"k": "16136",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingC}How do we open it?"
},
{
"k": "16137",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[to Crane] Don't say that."
},
{
"k": "16138",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Not up close."
},
{
"k": "16139",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingC}Well, {ThinkingB}that helps explain the glamour."
},
{
"k": "16140",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}Kind of."
},
{
"k": "16141",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{SadA}She used mundy drugs?"
},
{
"k": "16142",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}Looks like someone picked it out for her."
},
{
"k": "16143",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Maybe a prostitute like Faith."
},
{
"k": "16144",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Might be a spy."
},
{
"k": "16145",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Could be a warning."
},
{
"k": "16146",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[Pry open her fist]"
},
{
"k": "16147",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[Leave it alone]"
},
{
"k": "16148",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedB}open her coat?"
},
{
"k": "16149",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "They've been looking for her."
},
{
"k": "16150",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}The Woodsman told me about her…"
},
{
"k": "16151",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{FlusteredA}Holly's sister… {FearA}Lily."
},
{
"k": "16152",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}With that tattoo… It's gotta be Holly's sister, Lily."
},
{
"k": "16153",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{WorriedA}We have to go tell Holly."
},
{
"k": "16154",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}Right."
},
{
"k": "16155",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "I know it's dangerous, Crane."
},
{
"k": "16156",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "{ThinkingB}A deer?  {ThinkingC}What does that mean?"
},
{
"k": "16157",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "[mild surprise]{FearA}Oh!"
},
{
"k": "16158",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Neck Mark"
},
{
"k": "16159",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Brooch"
},
{
"k": "16160",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Rope Mark"
},
{
"k": "16161",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Fist"
},
{
"k": "16162",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Purple Lilacs"
},
{
"k": "16163",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Track Marks"
},
{
"k": "16164",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Coat Buttons"
},
{
"k": "16165",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Lingerie"
},
{
"k": "16166",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Pocket"
},
{
"k": "16167",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_witchingwellexamination",
"en": "Rolled Photograph"
},
{
"k": "16168",
